  "sourceRefs": [
    "Stedi (stedi.com/edi/x12-005010/segment/SV3) — the 278/837 dental service-line segment (this schema library's own SV1/professional and SV2/institutional service-line precedent, extended for dental). SV301 mirrors SV101's own compositeMedicalProcedureIdentifier shape (procedure code + up to 4 modifiers). Used at 278's own 2000F Service Level loop alongside SV1/SV2 — a claim/review carries exactly one of the three depending on the service's own professional/institutional/dental nature."
